    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🚨 AI Alarm Escalation — ACK + Timeout\n\n## Who's it for\nTeams running SCADA / industrial / IoT monitoring (or any system that emits alarms) who need on-call alerts that **escalate until a human acknowledges** — not fire-and-forget notifications.\n\n## How it works\n1. **Alarm in** — your source POSTs JSON to the webhook (PLC gateway, Node-RED, or any monitoring tool that can send a request).\n2. **Flood suppression** — repeat / flapping alarms are dropped inside a time window, so one fault pages a person once, not fifty times.\n3. **AI triage (optional)** — Claude summarizes the alarm and suggests a likely cause. Advisory only; it never decides suppression or who to notify.\n4. **Severity routing** — `critical` runs the escalation chain, `warning` notifies once, `info` is logged only.\n5. **Tiered escalation** — notify the on-call person and wait for an ACK. No acknowledgment within the timeout → escalate to the backup, then the manager.\n6. **Audit trail** — every outcome (suppressed / acknowledged / escalated) is logged.\n\n## How to set up\n1. Replace the four **Notify** nodes (currently Set placeholders) with your channel — HTTP Request, Slack, Gmail, or SMS. Keep the `ackUrl` field.\n2. *(Optional)* Enable **Claude Triage** and add a Header Auth credential (`x-api-key` = your Anthropic key).\n3. Wire the **Log** nodes to Google Sheets or a database.\n4. Tune the suppression window (Flood Suppression node) and the ACK timeout (Wait nodes).\n5. Activate the workflow and point your alarm source at the **Production** webhook URL.\n\n## Requirements\n- An alarm source that can POST JSON\n- A notification channel (Slack / email / SMS / webhook)\n- *(Optional)* An Anthropic API key for AI triage",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "526af28d-b078-4f30-8258-c1149b1455eb",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        8096,
        1408
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI triage — optional (disabled by default)\nClaude summarizes the alarm and suggests a likely cause. It **never** decides suppression or who to notify — deterministic rules do.\n\nEnable this node and add your Anthropic key to turn it on. Left off, alarms still escalate normally.",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
