    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Acknowledgment pattern\nEach notification carries `ackUrl` (`$execution.resumeUrl`). The recipient taps it — or your system POSTs `{ \"ack\": true }` to it — to acknowledge.\n\nNo ACK before the timeout → the Wait node escalates to the next tier.",
        "height": 346,
        "width": 412,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "a6b78a10-b88b-4ac0-9280-c4c8f6d56f50",
